  "summary": "Howdy all, We’ve rolled out version 8 of the Virtualmin installer, along with several other updates to support the new version of the Virtualmin virtual-server 8.0.0 module. A few of the big new features that have been introduced since the 7.0 release back in July of 2022. Changes in Pro WP Workbench, a plugin for centralized management and automation of many WordPress installations Major cloud provider enhancements and additions for managing DNS and backups in the cloud, including several ...",
